      "message": "Yeah, I had that as a requirement on the caller, which, yeah, it\u0027s messy.\n\nTo think of it a bit more ... it doesn\u0027t make sense to have `fSrc` here at all. We only use its size (to do math during `encodeRows`), so it probably makes more sense just to have a `SkISize` for that use.\n\nI\u0027ve moved this into the `SkJpegEncoder` class.",
